{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "scriptflow-api-v3",
		"name": "ScriptFlow API Collection v3.0",
		"description": "Complete API collection for ScriptFlow Backend - AI Reel Script Generation\n\n## Base URLs\n- **Local**: http://localhost:3000\n- **Production**: {{BASE_URL}}\n\n## Authentication\n- User endpoints use `subscriber_id` (ManyChat User ID)\n- Admin endpoints require `x-api-key` header\n\n## Version History\n- v3.0 (2026-01-08): Added V3 webhook, enhanced health checks, queue monitoring\n- v2.0: Added V2 script generation with hints\n- v1.0: Initial release",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"version": "3.0.0"
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "BASE_URL",
			"value": "http://localhost:3000",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "ADMIN_API_KEY",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "SUBSCRIBER_ID",
			"value": "12345678",
			"type": "string"
		}
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Health",
			"description": "Health check endpoints for monitoring and load balancers",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Basic Health Check",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/health",
							"host": [
								"{{BASE_URL}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"health"
							]
						},
						"description": "Basic health check for load balancers. Returns 200 if server is running."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Detailed Health Check",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/health/detailed",
							"host": [
								"{{BASE_URL}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"health",
								"detailed"
							]
						},
						"description": "Detailed health check including:\n- MongoDB connection status\n- Redis connection status\n- Queue statistics (waiting, active, completed, failed)\n- Memory usage and thresholds\n- Circuit breaker states\n- Degradation level\n- Alert flags for monitoring"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "V3 Webhook (FSM-Based)",
			"description": "V3 Unified webhook handler with FSM-based state management and intent classification",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Process Webhook (New Reel + Idea)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"subscriber_id\": \"{{SUBSCRIBER_ID}}\",\n  \"user_idea\": \"Make a script about productivity tips for morning routines\",\n  \"reel_url\": \"https://www.instagram.com/reel/ABC123/\",\n  \"tone_hint\": \"professional\",\n  \"language_hint\": \"en\",\n  \"mode\": \"full\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/api/v3/webhook",
							"host": [
								"{{BASE_URL}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"v3",
								"webhook"
							]
						},
						"description": "V3 Unified webhook endpoint with FSM-based state management.\n\n**Request Fields:**\n- `subscriber_id` (required): ManyChat subscriber ID\n- `user_idea` (optional): User's script idea or message\n- `reel_url` (optional): Instagram reel URL\n- `tone_hint` (optional): professional | funny | provocative | educational | casual\n- `language_hint` (optional): Language code (e.g., 'en', 'hi')\n- `mode` (optional): full | hook_only\n\n**Intent Detection:**\nThe system automatically detects intent from the message:\n- NEW_REEL: When reel_url contains Instagram link\n- SUBMIT_IDEA: When user sends text after submitting a reel\n- VARIATION: \"another\", \"different\", \"again\"\n- COPY: \"copy\", \"text\", \"script link\"\n- HELP: \"help\", \"hi\", \"hello\"\n- EXTRACT_ORIGINAL: \"exact\", \"original\", \"transcript\""
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Process Webhook (Reel Only)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"subscriber_id\": \"{{SUBSCRIBER_ID}}\",\n  \"reel_url\": \"https://www.instagram.com/reel/ABC123/\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/api/v3/webhook",
							"host": [
								"{{BASE_URL}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"v3",
								"webhook"
							]
						},
						"description": "Submit only a reel URL. System will prompt for idea."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Process Webhook (Idea for Existing Reel)",
					"request": {
